The free-roam relay and cloud saves (src/relay.rs, src/saves.rs, src/http.rs, src/ws.rs) are
a port of this project's own tools/carbon-net-relay.mjs.

The free-roam relay's interest management (src/relay.rs and tools/carbon-net-relay.mjs, "Interest"
in the latter's header; 2026-10-25) takes its ideas from nfsu2-web's free-roam hub
(web/server-rs/crates/roam/src/lib.rs, same commit and licence as above): each player gets the
players nearest to it, crew-mates first (at most 16) and race partners before everyone; "nearest"
looks ahead along the cars' speeds (1 s and 4 s on); a link already made is held for 5 s and then
counts at a fraction of its distance, so a newcomer must be much nearer to replace it. The code is
this project's own; none of nfsu2-web's was copied.

Crates used (each under its own licence, MIT or Apache-2.0): tokio, httparse, serde_json,
sha1 and sha2 (RustCrypto), and what they depend on (see Cargo.lock).
